{"title":"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Side_Note_to_Make_Solution_Faster\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Side Note to Make Solution Faster</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/1/5f14169c284e3892bc75537b563f01a5b975ac61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 1 + \\angle 2 = 180^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/2/54205ed43c0badda2d6690614c3b2e98d0affced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 3 = \\angle 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/024779d698ce7fe0551444a32dce168e990ee4cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"25\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f0cab5df9bf98e5c9cd3ffe8661ec2772becc8f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair H,I,J,K,L; H = (0,0); I = 10*dir(70); J = I + 10*dir(290); K = J + 5*dir(110); L = J + 5*dir(0); draw(H--I--J--cycle); draw(K--L--J); draw(arc((0,0),dir(70),(1,0),CW)); label(&quot;$70^\\circ$&quot;,dir(35),NE); draw(arc(I,I+dir(250),I+dir(290),CCW)); label(&quot;$40^\\circ$&quot;,I+1.25*dir(270),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,J+0.25*dir(162.5),NW); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,J+0.25*dir(17.5),NE); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,L+dir(162.5),WNW); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,K+dir(-52.5),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"202\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b95b5dd0db0db91ea4c885108512c90c49259fa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 20^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 25^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 30^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 35^\\circ \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 40^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the left triangle, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e8a94df2f64fa7284821443620e8b8560e2d198.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 1 + 70 + 40 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"153\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/1144a09bfe1fd3150ed6d3f835d64d61f65f5b64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 1 = 180 - 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"122\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbd7b322c4ea2cdd7e88d1ad4d2477cf62222435.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 1 = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Using the given fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/0/ef08fb5a936a4228d91b341d14aca99eb0e67614.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 1 + \\angle 2 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/21704c302d67612863873663b1a0cdf96bbec8dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 2 = 180 - 70 = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"164\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Finally, using the right triangle, and the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/2/54205ed43c0badda2d6690614c3b2e98d0affced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 3 = \\angle 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/a/b6ae06741dc51aafa57847fb8adaa9bb2f24cbe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 2 + \\angle 3 + \\angle 4 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"161\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa1856ab941717176619f14be5ae32f59774a553.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110 + \\angle 3 + \\angle 4 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"169\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb57163ba5b2d69da740a19381a9fe51c97b83d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$110 + \\angle 4+ \\angle 4 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"166\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c0eebb0e1bcb0f00a66d4d97bebc7620a5fdf0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\angle 4 = 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626574865d429b4c04361556e6710cf3c269cfba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 4 = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Side_Note_to_Make_Solution_Faster\">Side Note to Make Solution Faster</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Side Note to Make Solution Faster\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>You can use Exterior Angle Theorem to directly say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/d/15da59f451f576cfd9ad75123755ccf0759373f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 1 = \\angle 3+\\angle 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> instead of needing to use up time by doing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/a/b6ae06741dc51aafa57847fb8adaa9bb2f24cbe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 2 + \\angle 3 + \\angle 4 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"161\" height=\"14\" />, so on. Using exterior angle theorem goes straight to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/d/15da59f451f576cfd9ad75123755ccf0759373f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 1 = \\angle 3+\\angle 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />, and therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/3/f631ff2991130362f4043747d2d00be69d6ff5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(\\angle 4) = 70^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" />, as we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2ab82403efdd868515567caf9927fcb4e5e65663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}-40^{\\circ}-70^{\\circ} = \\angle 1 = 70^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"229\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/2/54205ed43c0badda2d6690614c3b2e98d0affced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 3 = \\angle 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/277dd53cf9a804825648c7a416c32e5ca6b1af19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle 4 = 35^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, so the answer is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~spacex_fanboy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME\" title=\"1997 AJHSME\">1997 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1997 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME\">AJHSME</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME Problems and Solutions\">AJHSME Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.ph